Toki no kirameki wo
I want to go see you

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.500
It's been 107 years since Lost Artemis.

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:12.040
Towa ni kaeru ichizusa de
The way the sparkle of an instant

